#: models.py:36
msgid "The Alliance whose members are checked."
msgstr "Die Alliance, deren Mitglieder geprüft werden."

#: models.py:43
msgid "Hostile below standing"
msgstr "Feindlich unter Standing"

#: models.py:44
msgid ""
"A contact of a ticked source counts as hostile when its standing is below "
"this value."
msgstr ""
"Ein Kontakt einer angehakten Quelle gilt als feindlich, wenn sein Standing "
"unter diesem Wert liegt."

#: models.py:49
msgid "Corporation changes per year"
msgstr "Corporation-Wechsel pro Jahr"

#: models.py:50
msgid ""
"A character that joined this many Corporations within the last 365 days gets"
" a marker."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character, der in den letzten 365 Tagen so vielen Corporations "
"beigetreten ist, bekommt einen Marker."

